---
type: readme
title: george.example.test payment test data README
summary: Explains that the george.example.test/webpay payment method test data redirects to harry.example.test/webpay, mirroring real-world domain redirects.
---

The payment method https://george.example.test/webpay redirects to
https://harry.example.test/webpay, similar to how https://google.com/pay
redirects to https://pay.google.com/about.
